@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Seeded book should already exist after startup
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/1

### Create a new book
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hazelcast Patterns",
  "author": "Example Author",
  "isbn": "978-1-99999-100-1",
  "genre": "Architecture"
}

### Read the entity twice to warm Hibernate L2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/2

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/2

### Read the explicit-serializer compact DTO
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/cache/2

### Read the reflective compact DTO
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/recommendations/2

### Update the entity and push an updated cache entry + recommendation
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/books/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hazelcast Patterns Revised",
  "author": "Example Author",
  "genre": "Cloud Architecture"
}

### Near-cache demo endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/2/near-cache-demo

### Built-in actuator near-cache probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/hazelcastNearCache?entity=io.github.javaquasar.hazelcast.toolkit.example.boot3.model.ExampleBookEntity&id=2

### Inspect cache stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/stats

### Delete the entity and evict Hazelcast map entries
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/books/2
